          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando <strong>bucles for</strong>, podemos escribir programas con mucho menos código y hacer que sea más fácil para otros programadores entenderlos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79131,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para crear un bucle <code>for</code> como este, añadimos la palabra clave <code>for</code>, una variable como <code>i</code>, la palabra <code>in</code>, y finalmente <code>range():</code></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range():\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>for</code> seguido de <code>i</code> y luego <code>in</code>, <code>range():</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79130,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>En un bucle <code>for</code> podemos especificar cuántas veces nos gustaría que nuestro bucle se ejecute con la declaración <code>range()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy birthday to you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>range</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79128,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agregar un número como <code>6</code> dentro de <code>range()</code> significa que iterará sobre el bloque de código 6 veces, desde <code>0</code> hasta <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>range</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>6</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>El número dentro de <code>range()</code> define cuántas veces se ejecuta el bucle, empezando en <code>0</code>. Haz que muestre del <code>0</code> al <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>range</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>6</code> y finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La variable antes de <code>in</code>, en este caso, <code>i</code>, es la variable contador. Cuenta en qué repetición del bucle estamos actualmente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For loops are great!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i</code> seguido de <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La variable antes de <code>in</code>, aquí <code>i</code>, es la variable contador. Indica en qué repetición del bucle estás.</p><p>Imprime el contador para que <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> y <code>2</code> aparezcan antes de <code>For loops are great!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For loops are great!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i</code> seguido de <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For keyword",
            "id": 79124,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué tipo de bucle tiene esto?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Are you ready?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un bucle <code>for</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un bucle <code>while</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un bucle <code>for</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Este código usa un bucle <code>for</code>. ¿Por qué aparece <code>Are you ready?</code> cuatro veces?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Are you ready?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">El bucle se ejecuta una vez por cada valor producido por <code>range(4)</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un bucle <code>for</code> siempre se ejecuta cuatro veces, sin importar su rango.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La variable contador <code>i</code> muestra el mensaje cuatro veces antes de que empiece el bucle.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">El bucle se ejecuta una vez por cada valor producido por <code>range(4)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 79123,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Dónde va la variable de bucle en un <code>for</code> loop?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Antes de la palabra clave <code>in</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Después de la declaración <code>range()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Antes de la palabra clave <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La variable de bucle en un bucle <code>for</code> va antes de la palabra clave <code>in</code>.</p><p>¿Qué encabezado usa <code>step</code> como variable de bucle durante tres repeticiones?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for step in range(3):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for in step range(3):</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for range(3) in step:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>for step in range(3):</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 79122,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es la variable de contador del bucle <code>for</code>? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>range</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>En este bucle <code>for</code>, <code>i</code> es la variable contador.</p><p>Si <code>print(i)</code> estuviera dentro del bucle, ¿qué valores mostraría?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code>, luego <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>, luego <code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>range</code>, luego <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>0</code>, luego <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 79121,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuántas veces aparecerá <code>be like me</code> en la consola?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody wants to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody wants to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">3</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">4</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir 3.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué cambio haría que <code>be like me</code> apareciera cuatro veces sin modificar el resto del código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody wants to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody wants to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cambiar <code>range(3)</code> por <code>range(4)</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mover <code>print(\"Everybody wants to\")</code> dentro del bucle.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Cambiar <code>range(3)</code> por <code>range(2)</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cambiar <code>range(3)</code> por <code>range(4)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing",
            "id": 79120,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué está mal con este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Falta la variable de contador después de la palabra clave <code>for</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No hay nada malo con el código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Falta la variable de contador después de la palabra clave <code>for</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un bucle <code>for</code> necesita una variable contador después de la palabra clave <code>for</code>.</p><p>¿Qué reemplazo corrige la primera línea para que <code>i</code> exista cuando se ejecute el bucle?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for i in range(5):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for range(5) in i:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for i range(5):</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>for i in range(5):</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: For keyword",
            "id": 79118,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arma la estructura de un bucle <code>for</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating accounts...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>for</code> seguido de <code>i</code> y luego <code>range</code>, <code>(4)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arma el encabezado del bucle para que se repita cuatro veces y muestre <code>Updating accounts...</code> en cada repetición.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating accounts...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(5)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>for</code> seguido de <code>i</code>, <code>range</code> y finalmente <code>(4)</code>.</p></body></html>"
